---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout title="About · kumiki" description="Why kumiki exists, and who's behind it.">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Like many others, I went headfirst into Japanese carpentry during COVID. I've also been
        designing games and software with some intensity for decades. Kumiki is the combined
        inspiration of my hobbies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Commercial CAD software carries a hefty price tag and leaves plenty to be desired for
        woodworking. Clunky interfaces with limited parametric features aren't ideal for
        representing repeating patterns of joints that follow systematic geometric rules.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I originally created kumiki, I figured few people would be willing to write
        <strong>CODE</strong> to make their <strong>DESIGNS</strong>, even with kumiki designed
        to be as simple and accessible as it is. By the time I released it, though, the agentic
        coding ship had sailed. I won't say much about that, except that it has, as a matter of
        fact, made kumiki more &mdash; not less &mdash; accessible as a CAD program.
      </p>
      <p>
        I hope you enjoy using it as much as I enjoy making it. Kumiki is free and open source!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/minimapletinytools/kumiki" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        View on GitHub
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={`${base}/`}>
        Back to home
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.2rem 0 2rem;
  }
  .about h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }
  .prose strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
